# items (SLMaxItems)
item.beyondthestars.homogenyTier2Core.name=Homogeny Tier II Core
item.beyondthestars.homogenyTier2Core.tooltip=The Homogeny T1 -> T2: build the middle stirring ring, mix 100,000 L of Excited Stellar Plasma Mixture,\nthen put this core in the controller and press Install (10 minutes, offline). Permanent.\n4 parallels; unlocks Degenerate Stellar Mixture.\nMade in the Condensate Assembler with Black Dwarf, White Dwarf and SpaceTime condensates (after Eye T5).
item.beyondthestars.homogenyTier3Core.name=Homogeny Tier III Core
item.beyondthestars.homogenyTier3Core.tooltip=The Homogeny T2 -> T3: build the tilted outer ring, mix 100,000 L of Degenerate Stellar Mixture,\nthen put this core in the controller and press Install (10 minutes, offline). Permanent.\n16 parallels; unlocks Entanglement Medium.\nMade in the Condensate Assembler with White Hole Matter (Eye T9), Superdense Ergomatter, Degenerate and Eternity condensates.\nEternity: the pack's Eternity line. Until this addon moves its loop onto Ergomatter it needs Universium (Eye T10), so this core waits for that change.
item.beyondthestars.universalUpgradeCore.name=Universal Upgrade Core
item.beyondthestars.universalUpgradeCore.tooltip=Eye of Harmony T9 -> T10.\nReassembled by Reality Refab from the six Entangled Regions.
item.beyondthestars.starChartUniverse.name=Star Chart: The Observable Universe
item.beyondthestars.starChartUniverse.tooltip=Eye of Harmony T10 target (not consumed).\nReassembled by Reality Refab.
