beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.tier=§eTIER §7T%s: unlocked T%s, bands T%s, compression T%s. Every compression generator must be tier N or higher.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.light=§eLIGHT IT §7A Stellar Ignition Charge in a plinth input bus, 10 cycles of upkeep in the buffers and 10 cycles of EU in the wireless network. The protostar contracts for about 40 seconds, then lights.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.run=§eRUN §7Every 60 s cycle the star burns its upkeep and EU. Upkeep is paid in full in every zone; a bad zone only cuts the yield.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.zones=§eZONES §7Resonant ±10 x1.25, Stable ±40 x1.00, Strained ±70 x0.50, Critical ±100 no yield, Breach: the star is lost. Integrity 0 also loses it.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.lock=§eLOCK §7Hold Resonant for 600 seconds in a row: yield x1.5 until the streak breaks.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.dial=§eDIAL §7Each +0.25 costs 10 x 2^(N-1) L/s of Tachyon Rich Temporal Fluid. Cap 1 + 0.25 x (Time Dilation tier - N). − / + steps it (right-click: four steps); the screwdriver too.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.feed=§eFEED §7(T4) Each litre of HSM fed makes 3.6864 L of White Dwarf Matter x mean Y x r.
beyondthestars.gui.eye.info.rig=§eAUTOMATE §7A sensor past its threshold, then redstone, then a Fluid Regulator cover or an export bus with a redstone card, into a plain input hatch in a Field socket. Two sensors per two-sided gauge.
