beyondthestars.gui.kerr.info.run1=§71. Put a Black Hole Seed in a bolt bus and press Open: the hole opens at 8 SM (solar masses).
beyondthestars.gui.kerr.info.run2=§72. It bleeds mass as Hawking radiation, 3.2 / M² SM a tick. Small holes die fast.
beyondthestars.gui.kerr.info.run3=§73. The governor fires bolts from the bolt buses to hold your setpoint (2-64 SM at T1).
beyondthestars.gui.kerr.info.run4=§74. While open, the hole draws 8,388,608 EU/t (1 A UEV) of containment. Without power the governor stops; below 2 SM the hole evaporates. The power switch does not stop the hole.
