beyondthestars.gui.module.info.maps.extractor=§eRUNS §7GT's Extractor recipes (items only).
beyondthestars.gui.module.info.link=§eLINK §7Runs only while linked to a formed Kerr Ergosphere Engine with an OPEN hole. When the hole closes it pauses and keeps its recipe; it resumes when the hole reopens.
beyondthestars.gui.module.info.bonus=§eBONUS §7The hole sets the bonus, fixed when a recipe starts: parallel 8 x voltage tier (this module's energy) x floor(sqrt(M)), speed x(3200/M)/50, from 1 to 4. A bigger hole gives more parallels, a smaller one more speed. The module costs the hole nothing.
beyondthestars.gui.module.info.place=§ePLACE §7This controller goes where the KEE's hologram shows marker %s, facing out of the cage. Its own hologram builds the arc.

